rly known as MSGE Spinco, Inc. Madison Square Garden Entertainment Corp. was incorporated in 2022 and is based in New York, New York.","ceo_bio":"Mr. James Lawrence Dolan | Executive Chairman & CEO | Age 70 | Compensation: $5.9M (FY2026)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 1K people. Revenue per employee of $1.0M ranks in the above the sector median among Communication Services peers, improving at 8%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Each employee generates $305K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $31K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 6\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (7/10).","financial_summary":["Madison Square Garden Entertain is a mid-cap communication services business with a $3.7B market cap on $1.1B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +8% over the past three years, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at 20% against a 9% cost of capital \u2014 a 11-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The business throws off $323M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 30 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 5.31\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","Accruals are elevated at -14.7% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 1.4\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and interest coverage runs at 3.5\u00d7.","Shareholder yield is only 0.7%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 4.1% of the shares."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Carries a 100% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":1.003057603057603},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 7.9% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Communication Services ETF trading well below its long-term trend","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Advertising-cycle exposure and content/regulatory risk \u2014 a single platform policy shift or ad-spend contraction cascades through the P&L quickly.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Cord-cutting acceleration and audience fragmentation \u2014 legacy distribution bundles unravel faster than subscription revenue can replace them.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"AI-generated content commoditisation \u2014 as creation costs collapse toward zero, content libraries lose pricing power and differentiation narrows.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Madison Square Garden Entertainment (NYSE:MSGE) Posts Earnings Results, Beats Expectations By $0.24 EPS","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/06/madison-square-garden-entertainment-nysemsge-posts-earnings-results-beats-expectations-by-0-24-eps.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1794004007.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.893,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Madison Square Garden Entertainment (MSGE) Stock May Be 40% Overvalued On Strong Q1 Results","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/media/nyse-msge/madison-square-garden-entert